00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.720
MILLION COLOR!

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.180
TURNS!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:27.060
<b>Golden Autumn</b>

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.200
This one can still be used...for supplies at least.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.820
I forbid it! The fleet under the Soleil needs to suppress the Ghingnham armada.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.710
Loran must have lured the Turn X to Lost Mountain south of the Alahaman Mountain range.

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:48.210
Let the Whales take charge of our fleet's formation.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:51.590
Commander Phil, have the Soleil proceed toward Lost Mountain!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.920
We should get Lieutenant Harry's opinion on this first.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.300
Please restrain your own feelings for at least a moment!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.890
You really should take some time to listen to the opinions of those below the Commander's rank!

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:06.310
I might get charged with treason for this questioning, but I intend to do what's necessary for the Queen's sake!

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:11.480
Sergeant Corin, are you gonna try using this again?

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.690
Good observation!

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:19.120
Could you ladies help me get these attached? Plug these nozzles into the left and right sockets.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.120
Plug these nozzles into both the left and right side, you say?

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:29.080
You'll need to hurry up there, Lady Sochie. We're in the middle of a war here.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.420
That's why I even bothered to deliver your "Rocket Punch" back to you.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.590
Alright, let's get this machine fired up and ready to go...

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.520
Looks like Miashei's finished.

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:40.040
Okay!

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.720
And what about my end?

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.220
You did well!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:48.190
Alright girls, you should go on home and prepare a nice warm meal for us all.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.100
What do you mean!?

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.690
- Sergeant Corin!
- What are you trying to do!?

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.200
Corin, you never told us you wanted to deploy on your own!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.620
You can't possibly intend to do that!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:07.120
Idiots, only young greenhorns would say something so dumb.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.040
Women like you should be the ones telling our descendants about how we soldiers...

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.390
...fought for their future!

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:21.590
You anywhere around Bruno, Jacop? It'll be your job to accommodate both ladies somewhere safe!

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.390
Did you hear that?

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.890
It was Sergeant Corin's voice!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.180
Did he give us his position?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.390
I've specified it.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.400
Fran, can you make it to the Whales?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.610
Of course.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:36.320
I rode this FLAT when I first came down here to the earth, you know?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.190
We'll leave it to you.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.990
Joseph, it'll be nice once we get you back to all of the others.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.780
Damn it...

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.120
Don't be so prejudice when you're not even awake yet.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.500
John, The remaining Mahiroo might still attack us on their own.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.800
Dianna Counter's forces don't even realize that, do they?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.590
That's what happens when people fight against their own.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.720
Is the Whales moving out?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.100
What is it? Did you make contact?

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.600
We're close enough, now.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.520
Princess, I have the Whales here for you.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.520
Here, take the mic.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.020
Sheesh...

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.310
Kihel Heim, can you hear me?

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.690
Can you tell me where "Mr. Turn A" is?

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.200
What fool's broadcasting that at full volume!?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.820
It's coming from that Gallop...

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.410
Block the Radio!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.120
Is anybody else there?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.490
On the other side of the Gallop!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.000
Willgem?!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.210
Sergeant Yanni, don't bother with the radio...

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.790
Also, don't take over the bridge's chair like that!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.420
If that's what you think is best, but I can still help...

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.010
No matter what, we have to make it to the factory!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.390
Well, we're not going to explode or anything! Settle down.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.510
Fo...forgive me.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.890
Lord... we...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.890
- Sorry...
- It's fine.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.690
Even if we make it to the factory to produce Mechanical Dolls, what do you intend to do then?

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:57.190
I think it's best to build up our mechanical doll forces, and then wait for things to cool down.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.400
It would also give us a chance to upgrade the Willgem.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.490
But if Ghingnham continues his reckless assault uninhibited...

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:07.120
If that were to happen, then Ameria will be destroyed!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:11.120
But that's why we still have to survive and create a contingency plan!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.420
Are you already planning your postwar actions?

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:17.080
You already know how I plan every step well in advance.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.300
It's no use, we're still losing altitude!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.710
Do something!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:23.880
This ship will be making an emergency landing.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:27.890
If you intend to leave this ship alive, just heed my orders!

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:29.890
I won't allow you to leave MY ship!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:33.520
I'm sorry Sir, but you should realize that we can no longer follow your commands!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.690
You bastards... You planned this from the start!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:39.690
I'm neither sharp nor courageous enough to pull that off!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.820
It's coming this way!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.200
Is it going to crash into us!?

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:56.000
This Turn A was also known as the White Doll, and it was revered by a great number of people!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:00.710
That is this machine's current nature. Therefore, I intend to use it to help everyone!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.720
Are you suggesting the Turn A changed its nature into something good while in hibernation?

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.090
Don't be foolish!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:09.220
There's no need for us to wipe out the Earth as it currently is!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.100
That's not true.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:16.520
It remained stagnant... and as time passed, the Terrans became unsatisfied with their current way of life...

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.690
...and they called for the Turn A to be awakened, boy!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.110
That's not true!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.900
But then...Why were Dianna's plans to return to the earth begun!?

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:28.110
Why did those on Earth reject her plan!?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.620
Why?

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.120
Past events that led to this age were a mistake!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:35.000
Mankind will never be able to forget how to wage war against itself!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:40.000
Therefore, I shall use the Turn X to wipe out everything and bring about the start of my own new era!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.590
Back off, Merrybell!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.390
You are not a part of this stage!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.810
You may have just used the Moonlight Butterfly...

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:56.680
...but that doesn't mean you're any good at fighting, Gym Ghingnham!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.020
So I'll help you defeat him!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.110
You're Merrybell, right?

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.410
Merrybell...

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:15.490
I spent my time raising you up till now... and yet your babbling proves you're lower than even the rivermen!

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:26.210
What's that? So you can fight after all, Gym?

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:38.890
WHAT THE...!?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.190
Brothers...

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.810
Don't call out the Moonlight Butterfly!

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.110
What is this!?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.110
These are the Mustache's marks, aren't they?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.120
Ghingnham and that kid Loran did this?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.620
Are all the major systems not fully restored? Doesn't look like I can escape.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.500
Merrybell, back me up!

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.300
He's going to...

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.880
SMASH THE WINDOW-HEAD!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:26.900
If I can't break those two out of that deadlock, the events of the Dark History will be repeated!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.990
I'LL HIT ITS CROTCH WITH MY ROCKET PUNCH!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.710
The Turn A should be the one...

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:44.290
...who finally builds the next era!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.210
Corin... Sergeant Corin!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:55.300
Battles like this are what awaken the great fighting instincts within people...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:09:00.390
Perhaps for animals, but humans have developed their own lengthy history!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:11.110
Very Good! Maybe if we allow these Turn units to drain all our energy while following our basic combat instincts...

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.990
...perhaps Earth's civilization won't end up being destroyed after all!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.910
Is that what you believe?

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.290
What's happening? The Soleil moved to the front?

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.090
Queen Dianna intends to blast the Turn X herself, right?

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:30.210
Is he going to be okay?

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.010
Joseph is stronger than that.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.880
My sister must be on the bridge...

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:38.890
The Whales will be supported by Lieutenant Harry's team and move to strengthen our rear!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:45.310
The Soleil will use all of its power to block the two "Turn" units by attempting to form a barrier against the Moonlight Butterfly!

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.900
Will that even be possible?

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:49.020
We'll have to believe that it is.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.610
We can only pray for success.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.490
Let us pray for it.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.700
Why is the Soleil moving to the front?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.290
Currently, no one will be able to stop Queen Dianna's battle-charge.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.500
The death of the Queen?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.420
The death of a King?

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.210
It's just like the Adeskan King...

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:21.220
You can't all ride that blimp!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.100
The Luzianna Militia still needs you! Come back!

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.890
These people...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.020
From the looks of it, even Colonel Michael has abandoned you now.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.320
So there you are. Lady Lily, you've always had a way of appearing whenever I'm at my lowest.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.490
It looks as though the sun will never rise again.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.700
Don't be so sure.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.410
A person still has their whole lifetime to succeed in the end.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.120
But your victory depends on whether Ameria still exists, correct?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:50.420
As of now, all I can do is pray that my lovely Laura will be victorious.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.710
"Laura" is a man, you know?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:56.010
If you really love him so much, why don't you put on a skirt instead?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:11:01.220
It'll take time before someone wearing a skirt is likely to be accepted as the leader of an industrial revolution.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.890
A Bandit...

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:12.690
Mallygan...

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.400
Sheesh...

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.820
Merrybell!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.700
- Captain!
- Please let us onboard!
- Captain!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.320
What happened? Where's Gym?

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:22.280
We need to use the Willgem's Mega Particle Cannon.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.910
No one is operating it anymore. That won't work.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.410
What's this?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.790
Why are you moving us by the Willgem?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.090
Why don't you ask the wind?

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:35.000
Lift the rope ladders!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.420
- Could it be...
- There's no way I'm going to let this stop us.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.220
- Should I pull them up?
- Let's head for Lost Mountain!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:47.560
Farewell! I'll be taking control of Ameria while I'm still wearing my skirt!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.360
You become very energetic when you fight, Laura!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.160
As death draws near, you learn what it truly means to be alive!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:10.160
The Dark History led to a path of nothing but destruction! That's why it was sealed!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.170
Wrong! It revitalized the cycle of life itself!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:16.290
Without battles, history will remain in this stagnant limbo!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.380
Don't twist things with your own selfish explanation!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.260
But you're fighting me right now!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.390
I'm only doing so to stop you!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:30.390
I am a human. My instincts can never be fully sealed!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:33.060
I'll never allow you to resurrect the history of warfare!

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:37.060
Then do you really think you can seal me away? Me, Gym Ghingnham?

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.160
Where's Loran?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.180
How is it, Commander Harry?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.090
We can't even identify which one is which.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:10.680
Everyone, we haven't seen the Moonlight Butterfly's full power yet!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.890
There's no way I'll let it take down the Soleil!

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.060
Hold your position there, Soleil!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.770
It doesn't matter if the Soleil falls, activate all of the barriers!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.780
Even if by only a little bit... we must prevent the Moonlight Butterfly from spreading!

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.360
Ma'am! We'll do what's necessary!

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:53.970
You gained your pride and strength in battle because it was meant to be used for protecting Queen Dianna!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.180
If that pride had been granted to us through Dianna...

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.480
...then Dianna was also able to take it from us.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.980
Rather than leading us, she choose to leave us behind without any acknowledgement!

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:08.070
If you fight for Dianna's sake, someone like yourself will never defeat me!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.070
Yes... Yes I will!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.080
Too slow!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.960
Only those who truly love to fight...!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.880
No, only one who fights without regard for them self...

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.260
CURSE YOU!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.980
You guard the front!
- We'll handle it.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.690
The Soleil has landed.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.360
Loran, respond if you can hear me!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.580
Gym Ghingnham...

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.500
Have you ever fought with a sword before?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.500
Yes, I did once.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.790
Very good, then.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:02.880
LET'S DO IT!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.390
Huh? It looks like an egg...

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.080
The Turn X and Turn A's reactions have ceased.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.670
Is that so?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.170
